==============================================================================
SUMMARY (candidate 1 / EBK)
==============================================================================
 - EBK is exact on the harmonic/integrable family (W1) and an approximation off it (W2).
 - hbar_eff = g = sqrt(2N/beta): 1.55 at beta=2.5 (N=3); 10% needs beta=600 (free theory) (W3).
 - the error grows with the ANHARMONICITY: -15% at quartic coupling 10 (W3b) -- and the
   target at beta=2.5 IS strongly anharmonic (g=1.55).
 - the error SIGN is not one-sided (W2: -2.7e-2 -> +2.5e-4 as hbar 1->0.125): in the
   high case N_EBK(Delta)=0 while N_exact(Delta)=1 (W4b) -- counting does not certify.
 - its rigorous 1D form is Sturm/Liouville: one-sided (0/8 violations) but VACUOUS
   (all 8 floors negative, min q<0) and 15.09x short on the corpus's own anchor (W5,W6);
   already dead in the corpus (LP-6 universality no-go, LP-7 no 2nd-order SL rep).
